  Pearson correlation (per-chromosome / aberration-type) between
  Mitelman CNV frequencies (Morph = 3111 , Topo = 0401) and TCGA-BRCA
  cytoband CNV frequencies.

  – Aberration types:  Amp  |  Gain  |  Loss  |  Del
